# QA Testing Checklist - Multiplayer Pong

## 🟢 Visuals & UI
- [ ] **Debug Toggle:** Overlay appears/disappears when pressing the toggle key (e.g., F3).
- [ ] **Performance:** FPS counter reflects real-time performance.
- [ ] **Sync Info:** Snapshot ID increments consistently during gameplay.

## 🔵 Networking
- [ ] **Latency:** Ping value is calculated and displayed accurately.
- [ ] **Prediction:** Check for "jitter" or teleporting when the ball hits a paddle.
- [ ] **Consistency:** Both clients see the same score at the same time.

## 🔴 Gameplay Mechanics
- [ ] **Collisions:** Ball bounces correctly off top/bottom walls.
- [ ] **Win Condition:** Game resets or ends correctly after the score limit is reached.
- [ ] **Input:** Input display correctly shows which keys are currently held down.